              "type": "qa",
              "q": "Protobuf field `string email = 4;` was deleted, then `int32 age = 4;` was added. What breaks?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "Identity is the field ==number==, so old bytes tagged 4 decode as the wrong type.",
                "Fix: `reserved 4;` and give `age` a new number."
              ]
            },
